#: ../../administration/settings/environments.rst:2
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../administration/settings/environments.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Environments section is where you create and manage your environment "
"labels, which are available in the `Environment` dropdown during Instance or"
" App provisioning. An Instance's environment label can be changed by editing"
" the Instance."
msgstr ""
"El Entornos sección es donde usted crear y manage su entorno labels, que "
"están disponibles en el `Entorno` menú desplegable durante Instancia o App "
"aprovisionamiento. Un Instancia's entorno label puede ser changed por "
"editing el Instancia."

#: ../../administration/settings/environments.rst:7
msgid "Creating Environments"
msgstr "Creando Entornos"

#: ../../administration/settings/environments.rst:9
msgid "Select `+ Create Environment`"
msgstr "Seleccionar `+ Crear Entorno`"

#: ../../administration/settings/environments.rst:10
msgid "Populate the following for the New Environment:"
msgstr "Populate lo siguiente para el Nuevo Entorno:"

#: ../../administration/settings/environments.rst:12
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nombre"

#: ../../administration/settings/environments.rst:13
msgid "The friendly name for the environment in |morpheus|"
msgstr "El friendly nombre para el entorno en |morpheus|"

#: ../../administration/settings/environments.rst:14
msgid "Code"
msgstr "Code"

#: ../../administration/settings/environments.rst:15
msgid "Shortcode used for API and CLI"
msgstr "Shortcode usado para API y CLI"

#: ../../administration/settings/environments.rst:16
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descripción"

#: ../../administration/settings/environments.rst:17
msgid "Environment description displayed on the Environments list page"
msgstr "Entorno description mostrado en el Entornos lista página"

#: ../../administration/settings/environments.rst:18
msgid "Display Order"
msgstr "Mostrar Order"

#: ../../administration/settings/environments.rst:19
msgid ""
"The order in which environments are presented when provisioning, a value of "
"\"0\" will position the environment at the top of the list"
msgstr ""
"El order en que entornos son presented cuando aprovisionamiento, a valor de "
"\"0\" va a position el entorno en el top de el lista"

#: ../../administration/settings/environments.rst:22
msgid "Visibility"
msgstr "Visibilidad"

#: ../../administration/settings/environments.rst:21
msgid "*Private*: Available only in the Tenant the environment is created in"
msgstr "*Private*: Disponible solo en el Inquilino el entorno es creado en"

#: ../../administration/settings/environments.rst:22
msgid ""
"*Public*: Available for all Tenants. Public is only applicable for "
"environments created in the the Master Tenant."
msgstr ""
"*Público*: Disponible para todos Inquilinos. Público es solo applicable para"
" entornos creado en el el Inquilino maestro."

#: ../../administration/settings/environments.rst:24
msgid ""
"User-created environments can be edited, hidden, or removed from the Actions"
" menu on the environments list page. |morpheus|-default environments can "
"only be hidden from users during provisioning."
msgstr ""
"Usuario-creado entornos puede ser edited, hidden, o removed desde el Actions"
" menu en el entornos lista página. |morpheus|-predeterminado entornos puede "
"solo be hidden desde usuarios durante aprovisionamiento."
